// The amphora: a lidded black-figure neck amphora, 1.5 m tall, built from a
// photograph. Its outline was traced from the photo (the Drive's
// "Incubator/3D Web/WI/amphora-trace.md", the overlay that checks it beside
// it), in metres, y up from the foot's underside, radius from the axis:
//
// - the jar, lid and all, is ONE lathe of that outline, 128 steps round,
//   solid (an ornament, not a vessel); the points are the trace's as given,
//   but for the lid's rim (1.23 to 1.29 m), where the photo's perspective
//   left the trace jagged by 5 mm either way: those radii are smoothed once
//   by a 1-2-1 filter, which keeps the lip's step and the rim's;
// - two handles, each a round tube (radius 0.0266) swept along the traced
//   centreline (a Catmull-Rom curve through the trace's ten points), in the
//   plane through the axis at +x and at -x, its ends carried on 3 cm into the
//   jar so they are buried, and joined to the jar's mesh;
// - its paint, an image read through the lathe's uv (u round from +x
//   towards -z, v along the outline in proportion to its length, as the
//   balloon's envelope is painted): every band of the trace's table, with
//   its geometric patterns (the shoulder's tongues, the foot's rays, the
//   chain of dots on the neck, the thin lines) and the two terracotta panels
//   front and back (+z and -z), black glaze under the handles. No figures or
//   palmettes. 2048 texels round and 2048 along, about a millimetre each,
//   each the mean of 2 x 2 samples;
// - its gloss: the black glaze glossy and the clay matt, by an ORM map
//   beside the paint (roughness 0.28 for the glaze, 0.8 for the terracotta),
//   drawn by render's physically based material. The handles read the
//   glaze's black from the foot's band.

const AMPHORA_STEPS = 128u32;           // the lathe's steps round
const AMPHORA_TIP f32 = 1.484;          // the bud's tip, on the axis
const HANDLE_RADIUS f32 = 0.0266;
const HANDLE_BURY f32 = 0.03;           // how far each end of a handle runs on into the jar
const PAINT_ROUND = 2048;               // the paint's texels round
const PAINT_ALONG = 2048;               // and along the outline

// The traced outline, foot to tip (radius, height), between the underside's
// (0, 0) to (0.1448, 0) and the tip (0, 1.484)
imm AMPHORA_OUTLINE Array[f32, 430] = [
  0.1014, 0.0069, 0.1448, 0.0137, 0.1465, 0.0206, 0.1512, 0.0275, 0.1495, 0.0344, 0.1469, 0.0412,
  0.1448, 0.0481, 0.1422, 0.0550, 0.1392, 0.0619, 0.1366, 0.0687, 0.1340, 0.0756, 0.1310, 0.0825,
  0.1289, 0.0893, 0.1246, 0.0962, 0.1078, 0.1031, 0.0936, 0.1100, 0.0893, 0.1168, 0.0902, 0.1237,
  0.0945, 0.1306, 0.1001, 0.1375, 0.1082, 0.1443, 0.1164, 0.1512, 0.1250, 0.1581, 0.1319, 0.1649,
  0.1387, 0.1718, 0.1465, 0.1787, 0.1529, 0.1856, 0.1594, 0.1924, 0.1654, 0.1993, 0.1714, 0.2062,
  0.1774, 0.2131, 0.1838, 0.2199, 0.1890, 0.2268, 0.1954, 0.2337, 0.2002, 0.2405, 0.2058, 0.2474,
